{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "english", "appid": 548430, "month": "2026-01", "window": 2, "start_date": 1767916800, "end_date": 1768521599, "month_true_total": 1518, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:29:44 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "216048331", "author": {"steamid": "76561198024060003", "personaname": "Ongar The Weary", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198024060003/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 48, "playtime_forever": 8874, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 8874, "last_played": 1700031332, "avatar": "8a96d1048fe079be629cf8ca5bb8d88398349814"}, "language": "english", "review": "Rock and Stone!", "timestamp_created": 1768520863, "timestamp_updated": 1768520863, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "216044245", "author": {"steamid": "76561198061950142", "personaname": "MIKAEL1", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198061950142/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 11605, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 11433, "last_played": 1769976539, "avatar": "58024986f3d1ae475dd2f394f39ab9279ac2743b"}, "language": "english", "review": "A really good Co-op shooter with lots of fun guns, gear and missions.", "timestamp_created": 1768515616, "timestamp_updated": 1768515616, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "216043446", "author": {"steamid": "76561198388997976", "personaname": "_1ceey_", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198388997976/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 33, "playtime_forever": 4204, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4204, "last_played": 1762867008, "avatar": "76a1216591de54804f64b4997645ed417cce8a81"}, "language": "english", "review": "[h1]Deep Rock Galactic — Mines, battles, friends[/h1]\n\nI first heard about Deep Rock Galactic as a budget version of [url=https://store.steampowered.com/app/553850/HELLDIVERS_2/][b]Helldivers 2[/b][/url], but it quickly became obvious that these are completely different games.\n\nThe game really shines in co-op. Each class has its own unique abilities and playstyle: one digs and mines, another shoots, a third provides support, and the fourth smashes obstacles and enemies. Teamwork is key: planning, dividing tasks, and helping each other makes every mission exciting and intense. And after a successful run, there’s nothing better than heading to the in-game bar with your squad — a little celebration after all the chaos. Even when everything goes wrong — explosions, cave-ins, hordes of enemies — it’s exactly this chaos that makes you laugh and jump back into the game.\n\nDeep Rock Galactic never gets old — every mission is different, with new maps, random events, and planetary hazards. The game keeps you on your toes and gives real enjoyment when playing with friends, and the crazy chaos of the expeditions makes you want to come back again and again.\n\n[b]FOR ROCK AND STONE![/b]\n\n7.5/10", "timestamp_created": 1768514684, "timestamp_updated": 1768643083, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.477620095014572144", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "216039638", "author": {"steamid": "76561198344714595", "personaname": "Qworo", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198344714595/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 5076, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2538, "last_played": 1773393320, "avatar": "ff06e7009046bb6fa875f6cca1b5841e7101f80e"}, "language": "english", "review": "good", "timestamp_created": 1768510534, "timestamp_updated": 1768510534, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "216038501", "author": {"steamid": "76561198260634118", "personaname": "DooDaD", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/DooDaD1/", "num_games_owned": 148, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 4435, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1867, "last_played": 1786305407, "avatar": "c63bc476bd1400ab7b5cf774001f18f07b1500ee"}, "language": "english", "review": "An absolute banger that everyone should try.", "timestamp_created": 1768509357, "timestamp_updated": 1768509357, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}]}